// CSP - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// CSP (Constraints-and-Solutions Problem) declares a domain of
// variables and the constraints over them, and a solver searches for
// an assignment. There is no output statement in the language at
// all, so the greeting lives in this comment.
// Hello World!
// var 0..3 domain;
// constraint all_different(var);
